oid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3145/314503/回声谣皮肤skill1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3145/314503/回声谣皮肤born.mp4_20260922_175924.640.png\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3145/314503/回声谣皮肤skill2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3145/314503/回声谣皮肤born.mp4_20260922_175924.640.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3145/314503/回声谣皮肤unique.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3145/314503/回声谣皮肤born.mp4_20260922_175924.640.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3145/314503/回声谣皮肤born.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3145/314503/回声谣皮肤born.mp4_20260922_175924.640.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">只要城堡的主人挥舞洁白的衣袖，鬼魂和幽灵便会倾巢而出——这个故事，一直流传在古堡之外。<br />咔嚓！镰刀劈下，切开的碎块四处飞溅，液体喷溅在早已锈蚀的盔甲上。呼啦！炉火舞动，鲜红的物体滋滋作响，难闻的气味透过铁栅四处弥漫。走廊里，白色的幽灵不住嘶吼，巨大圆形滚筒呼啸而过。<br />“都认真点！要赶不上宴会了！”<br />戴南瓜头的玩偶叫嚷着，可盔甲手中的镰刀势大力沉，早已将南瓜灯的表情雕刻得比哭还难看；壁炉里的鬼魂只顾生火，让焦糖苹果变成了焦糊苹果；装满西打酒的木桶们刹不住车，甜美的酒水全洒落墙缝……<br />一波三折后，这场深秋的宴会最终如期举行。故事中的鬼魂们试图跳出圆舞曲的节拍，在他们不曾注意的窗外，“城堡主人钟爱‘咚咚’的怪声”，这个情节即将成为新故事的灵感。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"314503\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-314504.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/0d/Belonging-314504.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“誓言尚且驻留”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"A Vow to the Spirits\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>覆满岁月痕迹的白纱，受访者于礼堂中将它拾起。祝福殷切、道别哀戚……一方白纱承载了太多真挚的声音，受访者不忍它们飘零四散，于是，她将白纱郑重地系在发间，让声音在她的耳畔停驻。<br />“请不要哭泣……我发誓，会与大家一同在这里。”受访者的安抚卓有成效，风声与呜咽竟即刻止息。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-314505.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/dd/Belonging-314505.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">小南瓜？小洪扎！<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Pumpkin? Honza!</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />2<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>奇异南瓜头形状的木质手偶，在正式介绍前便抢先叫喊：“不给糖，就捣蛋！”<br />对此，受访者表示了一定的歉意。她宣称这是伙伴表达热情的方式，颇具怪异风格的装束与高昂的语调更容易使客人感受到节日氛围。笔者据此猜测，古堡中“尖叫南瓜头”的传说亦可能与其有关。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-314506.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/84/Belonging-314506.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">自然饰物<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Festive Ornament</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>带有细小毛刺的南瓜花与藤蔓。在寄居南瓜中的数位魂灵朋友推荐下，受访者将其装饰在自己的发间和裙边——“明艳的颜色象征着热情与希望，古堡中正需要这样的温暖……”<br />经受访者与其朋友们的热情建议，笔者尝试戴上了不算舒适的同款手环，并谢绝了后续“南瓜变装派对”的邀约。</div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"全新语音\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.85.A8.E6.96.B0.E8.AF.AD.E9.9F.B3_New_Voice\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"全新语音_New_Voice\">全新语音<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">New Voice</span></small></span></h2><div><table class=\"wikitable responsive voice-table zh-only\" style=\"margin:0; --size: 23px; width:100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"hide-m\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><td style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Tupo xindiantu.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/107px-Tupo_xindiantu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"30\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/161px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/214px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"740\" data-file-height=\"208\" /></td><th>EN</th><th>中</th><th class=\"not-zh\">日</th><th class=\"not-zh\">한</th><th>文本</th></tr><tr><th>初遇</th><td><span class=\"hide-pc\">EN </span><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"En_play_hero314503_mainvoc_71.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314503_mainvoc_71\"></i><i class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc\">中 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Zh_play_hero314503_mainvoc_71.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314503_mainvoc_71\"></i></span><i class=\"hide-pc not-zh\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc not-zh\">日 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Jp_play_hero314503_mainvoc_71.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314503_mainvoc_71\"></i></span><i class=\"hide-pc not-zh\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc not-zh\">한 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Kr_play_hero314503_mainvoc_71.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314503_mainvoc_71\"></i></span></td><td class=\"hide-m\"><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Zh_play_hero314503_mainvoc_71.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314503_mainvoc_71\"></i></td><td class=\"hide-m not-zh\"><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Jp_play_hero314503_mainvoc_71.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314503_mainvoc_71\"></i></td><td class=\"hide-m not-zh\"><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Kr_play_hero314503_mainvoc_71.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314503_mainvoc_71\"></i></td><td>维尔汀，把手给我——瞧，我从大家哼的歌谣里听过，馨香的花儿捆成束……<i>拿稳了，朋友！</i><div class=\"grey-small\">Vertin, please reach out your hand. I heard a lovely song ... and I learned to make a pretty bouquet from it. &lt;Don't you drop it, chummy-wum!&gt; </div></td></tr><tr><th>衣着与身形</th><td><span class=\"hide-pc\">EN </span><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"En_play_hero314503_mainvoc_72.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314503_mainvoc_72\"></i><i class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc\">中 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Zh_play_hero314503_mainvoc_72.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314503_mainvoc_72\"></i></span><i class=\"hide-pc not-zh\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc not-zh\">日 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Jp_play_hero314503_mainvoc_72.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314503_mainvoc_72\"></i></span><i class=\"hide-pc not-zh\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc not-zh\">한 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Kr_play_hero314503_mainvoc_72.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314503_mainvoc_72\"></i></span></td><td class=\"hide-m\"><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Zh_play_hero314503_mainvoc_72.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314503_mainvoc_72\"></i></td><td class=\"hide-m not-zh\"><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Jp_play_hero314503_mainvoc_72.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314503_mainvoc_72\"></i></td><td class=\"hide-m not-zh\"><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Kr_play_hero314503_mainvoc_72.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314503_mainvoc_72\"></i></td><td>鹭鸶剪小姐说，我可以调节身体里光线的强弱，从而让南瓜花生长得更为繁盛……但，它们仿佛从不枯萎，也从未新生。当微风吹拂我的身体时，它们随之轻轻摇曳。<div class=\"grey-small\">Ms. Heron said if I harness the stream of light inside me, I can help the pumpkin flowers grow, but ... what does that mean? I have never seen them wilt or bud.  They have always been as they are now, swaying softly whenever a breeze brushes against my skin. </div></td></tr><tr><th>入队</th><td><span class=\"hide-pc\">EN </span><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"En_play_hero314503_fightingvoc_55.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314503_fightingvoc_55\"></i><i class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc\">中 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Zh_play_hero314503_fightingvoc_55.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314503_fightingvoc_55\"></i></span><i class=\"hide-pc not-zh\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc not-zh\">日 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Jp_play_hero314503_fightingvoc_55.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314503_fightingvoc_55\"></i></span><i class=\"hide-pc not-zh\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><sp